  <div class="portal-checklist-title">PUSH NOTIFICATION CONFORMANCE MANDATES</div>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Backstack Preservation:</strong> Deep links opened from notifications must construct the parent backstack (e.g. using <code>TaskStackBuilder</code> on Android) so that pressing Back navigates to the Home screen rather than exiting the app.</li>
    <li><strong>Notification Channels Mandatory:</strong> Android push notifications must specify registered notification channels with defined importance levels. Posting notifications to undefined channels is blocked.</li>
    <li><strong>Payload Verification:</strong> Deep link query parameters must be validated with Zod/regex before navigating to prevent malicious intent injection.</li>
    <li><strong>Silent Push Limits:</strong> Silent background notifications must finish processing within 30 seconds to respect operating system battery governance.</li>
